<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Multiagent Protocols with Aggregated Confidence Signals" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Results</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In 5 Results ‣ Multiagent Protocols with Aggregated Confidence Signals" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">The aggregated confidence reported by multiagent protocols is highly discriminative.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 5 Results ‣ Multiagent Protocols with Aggregated Confidence Signals" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Confidence-based routing protocols recover most of MAD’s losses in task accuracy.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In 5 Results ‣ Multiagent Protocols with Aggregated Confidence Signals" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Analysis on Confidence Estimators.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In 5 Results ‣ Multiagent Protocols with Aggregated Confidence Signals" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">WSV results in higher F1 while CGA and HID result in higher AUARC.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px5" title="In 5 Results ‣ Multiagent Protocols with Aggregated Confidence Signals" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Confidence calibration is essential, and higher performances are achieved using parametric calibrations.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS1" title="In 5 Results ‣ Multiagent Protocols with Aggregated Confidence Signals" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.1 </span>Insights on Debate From Confidence Perspective</span></a>
