<span id="A5.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">The stance can fall into one of three categories: Against, Supporting, or Neutral.
