<span id="A5.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Detect the stance of the writer toward. Give only one word as a response with {Neutral, Support, Against}.
</span></span>
