<span id="A5.p3.pic1.p3.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p3.pic1.p3.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Other agent’s chain-of-thought: <span id="A5.p3.pic1.p3.pic1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;">{Other Agent’s CoT}</span>
