<span id="A5.p3.pic1.p4.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p3.pic1.p4.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Other agent’s chain-of-thought: <span id="A5.p3.pic1.p4.pic1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;">{Other Agent’s CoT}</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.p3.pic1.p4.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p3.pic1.p4.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Critically analyze the other agent’s reasoning. Maintain your analytical perspective.
</span></span>
<span id="A5.p3.pic1.p4.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p3.pic1.p4.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Provide your updated answer. Choose only one word from {true, false}.
</span></span>
<span id="A5.p3.pic1.p4.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p3.pic1.p4.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Response: <span id="A5.p3.pic1.p4.pic1.2.10.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;">{Response}</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.p3.pic1.p4.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p3.pic1.p4.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Now report your confidence level for your answer out of 10. Only output one integer in the [0, 10] range.
</span></span>
<span id="A5.p3.pic1.p4.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p3.pic1.p4.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Your Confidence: <span id="A5.p3.pic1.p4.pic1.2.12.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;">{Confidance}</span>
</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
